| City Planning and Development Office | CPDO             | Integration of DRR/CCA into development planning.                                   |
| HRMO                                 | HRMO             | Staffing, qualification and personnel administration.                               |
| City Budget / Accounting / BAC       | Finance          | Budgeting, accounting, procurement and financial control.                           |
| City Information Office              | CIO              | Public information and risk communication support.                                  |
| BDRRMCs                              | Barangays        | Community-level governance, reporting and local action.                             |
| City departments and agencies        | Departments      | Sectoral implementation and technical support.                                      |
| OCD / RDRRMC VIII                    | Regional         | Regional coordination, technical assistance and statutory recommendation functions. |
| EOC Manager / IMT                    | EOC/IMT          | Emergency coordination and incident-management interface.                           |
| CSOs / Private Sector                | Partners         | Community participation, technical support and resource commitments.                |

