| CDRRMC resolutions with assigned owners and deadlines                              | 100%                                       | Every meeting        | Secretariat        |
| CDRRMC action items with documented status                                         | 100% tracked                               | Quarterly            | CDRRMO             |
| Critical DRRM policies subjected to legal review                                   | 100% before approval                       | Per policy           | City Legal Office  |
