| State of Calamity recommendations with supporting RDANA                            | 100%                                       | Per occurrence       | CDRRMO             |
| State of Imminent Disaster requests with complete PDRA documentation               | 100%                                       | Per applicable event | CDRRMO             |
| State of Imminent Disaster post-lifting reports submitted within prescribed period | 100%                                       | Per declaration      | CDRRMO             |
| CDRRMC decisions with documented follow-through                                    | 100% recorded                              | Quarterly            | CDRRMO Secretariat |
